data: {"id": "bd04bd38f54c494a-thinking-parallel_evidence-746", "run_id": "bd04bd38f54c494a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实\n\n1.  **Pod 当前状态 (Kubernetes Describe)**\n    *   **Phase: Pending**, Node: `<none>`。\n    *   **直接原因**: `FailedScheduling` 事件明确指出 `3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`。\n    *   **关键配置冲突**: Pod 设置了 NodeSelector `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`。\n\n2.  **集群节点状态 (kubectl get nodes)**\n    *   集群共有 3 个节点 (`master`, `node1`, `node2`)，全部处于 `Ready` 状态。\n    *   **关键事实**: 没有任何节点拥有标签 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`（从输出的 Labels 列表可见，所有节点均只有标准的 `beta.kubernetes.io/*` 和 `node-role.kubernetes.io", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788764536641, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "bd04bd38f54c494a-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "bd04bd38f54c494a", "seq": 747, "ts_ms": 1788764543452, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 31.862, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-01", "name": "workload-68c557d875-bsq52"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/bd04bd38f54c494a-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "ac3dbb9c9f5c29d8cba3763ab5ad897f517cd133f1bc6b109e4e6959f095a984", "bytes": 2633}, "snapshot_sha256": "78834e994f758ba952109f5af67157de5a609e395b01e9a5ae1e0b4be152354b"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

